ly-motivation-manifest\",\"contentAdvisoryRating\":\"4+\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"currentVersionReleaseDate\":\"2026-06-15T22:54:42Z\",\"description\":\"Unlock the Power of Affirmations with Our App!\\n\\nTransform your life one positive thought at a time. The Affirmations App helps you harness your inner strength, align with your desires, and create the life you’ve always dreamed of. Whether you’re looking to attract MONEY, improve your SLEEP, or foster a deeper SPIRITUAL connection, this app is your ultimate guide to manifesting positivity and success.\\n\\nWhy Use Affirmations?\\nAffirmations are more than just words—they are powerful declarations of what you want to create in life. By practicing daily affirmations, you can reprogram your mind, overcome negativity, and achieve your goals. Whether you’re seeking financial abundance, a BIBLICAL perspective, or a more POSITIVE mindset, affirmations offer a proven way to transform your thoughts into actions.\\n\\nHow It Works:\\n- Discover Daily Affirmations: Choose from expertly curated categories like success, relationships, gratitude, and JOURNAL prompts for deeper reflection.\\n- Create Your Own: Be your own affirmation CREATOR and design personalized affirmations tailored to your unique journey.\\n- Build a Daily Routine: Use customizable tools like affirmation WIDGETS and a calming ALARM to keep your practice consistent.\\n- Features of the Affirmations App:\\n- A vast library of affirmations designed for success, money, and personal growth\\n- Custom JOURNAL for tracking affirmations and personal insights\\n- Beautiful WIDGET designs to keep affirmations visible throughout your day\\n- Calming ALARM tones to start and end your day with positivity\\n- Tools for crafting personalized affirmations as your own affirmation MAKER\\n\\nWhy Affirmations Work:\\nYour thoughts shape your reality. By focusing on POSITIVE affirmations daily, you can foster self-love, embrace abundance, and align your actions with your goals. Whether you’re connecting with BIBLICAL principles, improving SLEEP, or achieving financial success, affirmations are the key to living with purpose. This app helps you cultivate a mindset that supports both your SPIRITUAL and personal growth.\\n\\nLive Your Best Life: \\nThe Affirmations App is your gateway to mindfulness and intentional living. Whether you’re looking to attract MONEY, build confidence, or deepen your SPIRITUAL awareness, this app supports your growth every step of the way. Make affirmations a part of your daily routine, and watch as positivity transforms your life into the one you’ve always envisioned.\\n\\nDownload the Affirmations App today and become the CREATOR of your best self!\",\"features\":[\"iosUniversal\"],\"fileSizeBytes\":\"184094720\",\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\",\"genreIds\":[\"6013\",\"6007\"],\"genres\":[\"Health & Fitness\",\"Productivity\"],\"ipadScreenshotUrls\":[],\"isGameCenterEnabled\":false,\"isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled\":true,\"kind\":\"software\",\"languageCodesISO2A\":[\"EN\"],\"minimumOsVersion\":\"15.0\",\"price\":0.0,\"primaryGenreId\":6013,\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-09T07:00:00Z\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Brand new redesigned experience\\n- New iOS glass design for a modern look\\n- Improved widgets for your home screen\\n- Apple Watch experience upgraded\\n- Faster performance across the app\\n- Bug fixes and stability improvements\\n\\nThank you to everyone for all the great support! We are working very hard to get stuff done. In this update you'll find bug fixes, small improvements and performance enhancements. If you love Affirmations App, please rate us, it would really help! :)\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"sellerName\":\"Appcano LLC\",\"supportedDevices\":[\"iPhone5s-iPhone5s\",\"iPadAir-iPadAir\",\"iPadAirCellular-iPadAirCellular\",\"iPadMiniRetina-iPadMiniRetina\",\"iPadMiniRetinaCellular-iPadMiniRetinaCellular\",\"iPhone6-iPhone6\",\"iPhone6Plus-iPhone6Plus\",\"iPadAi