iPadAirFifthGenCellular\",\"iPhone14-iPhone14\",\"iPhone14Plus-iPhone14Plus\",\"iPhone14Pro-iPhone14Pro\",\"iPhone14ProMax-iPhone14ProMax\",\"iPadTenthGen-iPadTenthGen\",\"iPadTenthGenCellular-iPadTenthGenCellular\",\"iPadPro11FourthGen-iPadPro11FourthGen\",\"iPadPro11FourthGenCellular-iPadPro11FourthGenCellular\",\"iPadProSixthGen-iPadProSixthGen\",\"iPadProSixthGenCellular-iPadProSixthGenCellular\",\"iPhone15-iPhone15\",\"iPhone15Plus-iPhone15Plus\",\"iPhone15Pro-iPhone15Pro\",\"iPhone15ProMax-iPhone15ProMax\",\"iPadAir11M2-iPadAir11M2\",\"iPadAir11M2Cellular-iPadAir11M2Cellular\",\"iPadAir13M2-iPadAir13M2\",\"iPadAir13M2Cellular-iPadAir13M2Cellular\",\"iPadPro11M4-iPadPro11M4\",\"iPadPro11M4Cellular-iPadPro11M4Cellular\",\"iPadPro13M4-iPadPro13M4\",\"iPadPro13M4Cellular-iPadPro13M4Cellular\",\"iPhone16-iPhone16\",\"iPhone16Plus-iPhone16Plus\",\"iPhone16Pro-iPhone16Pro\",\"iPhone16ProMax-iPhone16ProMax\",\"iPadMiniA17Pro-iPadMiniA17Pro\",\"iPadMiniA17ProCellular-iPadMiniA17ProCellular\",\"iPhone16e-iPhone16e\",\"iPadA16-iPadA16\",\"iPadA16Cellular-iPadA16Cellular\",\"iPadAir11M3-iPadAir11M3\",\"iPadAir11M3Cellular-iPadAir11M3Cellular\",\"iPadAir13M3-iPadAir13M3\",\"iPadAir13M3Cellular-iPadAir13M3Cellular\",\"iPhone17Pro-iPhone17Pro\",\"iPhone17ProMax-iPhone17ProMax\",\"iPhone17-iPhone17\",\"iPhoneAir-iPhoneAir\",\"iPadPro11M5-iPadPro11M5\",\"iPadPro11M5Cellular-iPadPro11M5Cellular\",\"iPadPro13M5-iPadPro13M5\",\"iPadPro13M5Cellular-iPadPro13M5Cellular\",\"iPhone17e-iPhone17e\",\"iPadAir11M4-iPadAir11M4\",\"iPadAir11M4Cellular-iPadAir11M4Cellular\",\"iPadAir13M4-iPadAir13M4\",\"iPadAir13M4Cellular-iPadAir13M4Cellular\"],\"trackCensoredName\":\"Gratitude: Self-Care Journal\",\"trackContentRating\":\"4+\",\"trackId\":1372575227,\"trackName\":\"Gratitude: Self-Care Journal\",\"trackViewUrl\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gratitude-self-care-journal/id1372575227?uo=4\",\"userRatingCount\":44899,\"userRatingCountForCurrentVersion\":44899,\"version\":\"5.7.6\",\"wrapperType\":\"software\"},{\"advisories\":[],\"appletvScreenshotUrls\":[],\"artistId\":1473227267,\"artistName\":\"Alexey Reshetnikov\",\"artistViewUrl\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/alexey-reshetnikov/id1473227267?uo=4\",\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/32/e0/9c/32e09c35-0918-3c49-8f3b-637bd7f0bec7/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"artworkUrl512\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/32/e0/9c/32e09c35-0918-3c49-8f3b-637bd7f0bec7/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg\",\"artworkUrl60\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/32/e0/9c/32e09c35-0918-3c49-8f3b-637bd7f0bec7/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/60x60bb.jpg\",\"averageUserRating\":4.80975,\"averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion\":4.80975,\"bundleId\":\"daily.quotes.affirmations\",\"contentAdvisoryRating\":\"4+\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"currentVersionReleaseDate\":\"2026-05-26T21:56:42Z\",\"description\":\"Daily affirmations app Miracle is one of the best affirmations apps for iPhone with widgets. Build motivation, shift your mindset, and bring more positivity into your day.\\n\\nUse daily affirmations and motivational quotes to push through challenges and stay focused on what you want. Miracle is an affirmations app for women built around daily affirmations for positivity and self-belief, designed to actually fit into your routine instead of just sitting on your home screen.\\n\\nKey Features:\\n• Daily Affirmations\\nStart each day with an affirmation matched to your goals. Whether you want daily affirmations for women, morning affirmations, or powerful daily affirmations, Miracle gives you words that support self-belief and a positive mindset from the moment you wake up.\\n\\n• Affirmation Practice, Your Voice and Your Pace\\nRun guided affirmation sessions the way you want. Choose the voice that reads your affirmations out loud, and set how long each step of the practice lasts. Slow and grounding before bed, or quick and focused before a meeting. Both work.\\n\\n• Adaptive Widgets\\nAdd adaptive widgets to your Home Screen. They adjust to your wallpaper and time of day, surfacing a fresh affirmation whenever you glance at your phone.\\n\\n• Lock Screen Widgets\\nSet an affirmation as your lock screen so a positive thought greets you every time you pick up your phone.\\n\\n• Ambient Sounds\\nAdd rain, sea, birds, night, and other ambient sounds. Use them during practice, or just as background while you read your affirmations.\\n\\n• Custom Fonts\\nChange the font your affirmations are written in. Find one that feels right to read.\\n\\n• Custom Backgrounds\\nPick a background from different categories to make the app look the way you want it to.\\n\\n• iOS 26 Alarms Integration\\nWake up to your affirmations. Miracle plugs into iOS 26 Alarms, so your morning practice begins the moment your alarm goes off, not as one more notification fighting for attention.\\n\\n• Customizable Reminders\\nSchedule reminders for the times that work for you. Morning affirmations to start the day, positive affirmations any time you need a reset. Our daily affirmations for women app keeps you consistent.\\n\\n• Positive Daily Affirmations Library\\nBrowse a full library of affirmations, sorted by category: positive affirmations for women, powerful daily affirmations, manifest affirmations, and more. Find the right words for the moment.\\n\\n• Save and Favorite\\nSave the affirmations that resonate to your personal collection in our free affirmations app. Build a library of daily affirmations for women, positive affirmation quotes, and favorites you come back to. You can also write your own.\\n\\n• Share the Positivity\\nSend your favorite affirmations to friends and family through social media, text, or email.\\n\\n• Clean, Simple Interface\\nEasy to navigate, easy to use. Open the app, get what you came for, move on with your day.\\n\\nLooking for the best affirmation app? Download Miracle now and start building the mindset you want.\\n\\nTerms of use: https://reshetnikoff.com/terms/\\nPrivacy policy: https://reshetnikoff.com/policy/\",\"features\":[],\"fileSizeBytes\":\"133370880\",\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\",\"genreIds\":[\"6012\",\"6013\"],\"genres\":[\"Lifestyle\",\"Health & Fitness\"],\"ipadScreenshotUrls\":[],\"isGameCenterEnabled\":false,\"isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled\":true,\"kind\":\"software\",\"languageCodesISO2A\":[\"EN\"],\"minimumOsVersion\":\"17.0\",\"price\":0.0,\"primaryGenreId\":6012,\"primaryGenreName\":\"Lifestyle\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-02T07:00:00Z\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Practice reminder bug fix\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/34/12/0b/34120b9c-4b96-ca8f-2624-a7d2808d37ed/2441a9a3-afac-4771-913a-f67bd1eb88bd_1._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/e5/fe/61/e5fe61c4-5ba0-978f-5846-043a3fddea70/79ae195c-3d8e-462a-9af6-a7a0acc7bf9e_2._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/31/b9/45/31b94520-db97-6ae3-5750-634af9dca9a5/ee2d4afb-6f2b-4f3f-8e44-b5884a31d24a_3._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/30/36/da/3036dac1-59b2-84bb-48f3-18722bd94c78/c798679f-4a9f-4d56-b5fe-133d846a20c1_4._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/bf/b9/e2/bfb9e2e7-aec5-8338-56a8-457459d63d54/ac6a53d2-7639-4dd2-b754-75a6be4229e8_5._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/75/5e/03/755e0390-f746-67f9-d3de-263d582a2c4a/e4fa8530-5e85-4b89-be4b-d14fbc3d599f_6._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\"],\"sellerName\":\"Alexey Reshetnikov\",\"supportedDevices\":[\"iPhone5s-iPhone5s\",\"iPadAir-iPadAir\",\"iPadAirCellular-iPadAirCellular\",\"iPadMiniRetina-iPadMiniRetina\",\"iPadMiniRe